---
title: Lentil Soup
description: A red lentil soup for the week's lunches.
servings: 6
course: lunch
cuisine: middle eastern
prep time: 10 min
cook time: 35 min
tags: [vegan, batch, lunch]
---
Soften @onion{1} and @carrots{2}, chopped, in @olive oil{2%tbsp} in a #large pot{} for ~{8%minutes}.

Add @garlic{3%cloves}, @cumin{2%tsp} and @smoked paprika{1%tsp} and stir for ~{1%minute}.

Pour in @red lentils{300%g}, @chopped tomatoes{400%g} and @vegetable stock{1.5%l}. Simmer for ~{25%minutes}.

Blend half of it, season with @salt{} and @lemon juice{1%tbsp}.
